# Runtime state that the harness produces outside the tracked
# .agent/state/ tree.

# Exchange/invocation branch worktrees (ARCH §2.3) — each `lernie
# prompt` invocation allocates `.lernie/worktrees/<branch-path>/` for
# its branch. Worktrees are cross-branch state and must not land on
# `main`'s tree.
.lernie/
